    ["club位置"] = "позиция в клубе",
    ["……这张悲喜剧面具名为“戏剧大师”，对应序列8 戏法大师。上面融合了戏剧大师蒙特利死前残留的力量，比较危险。戴上面具后，使用者即可掌握一系列不算强力的戏法，包括刮风、制造雾气、爆发闪光等。但只要把它戴在身上，就会有一定几率迷路。除此之外，使用者在佩戴期间，会越来越觉得自己是一个真正的戏剧大师，身边的人会控制不住地按照自己的意愿去表演一出喜剧或悲剧，所以佩戴时间不得超过两个小时。"] = "...This tragicomedy mask is called 'Drama Master', corresponding to Последовательность 8, Trickmaster. It contains the residual power of the late Drama Master Monterey, making it quite dangerous. Upon wearing the mask, the user gains a series of not-so-powerful tricks, including summoning wind, creating fog, and bursting flashes. However, as long as it is carried on one's person, there is a certain chance of getting lost. Furthermore, while wearing it, the user will increasingly feel like a true drama master, and those around them will uncontrollably perform a comedy or tragedy according to the user's will, so it must not be worn for more than two hours.",
